00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:41.300
We had initially in the first draft where you were going to be, it was Halloween all

345
00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:41.440
day.

346
00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:44.720
So it was just going to be you running around the New York office as the only person dressed

347
00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.740
for Halloween, trying not to look like Hitler.

348
00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:48.860
And it was a fun little runner for you.

349
00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:52.980
But I think the story we got eventually with Jim's brothers and that beautiful thing with,

350
00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:58.120
