00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:26.000
So we have the scripts thanks to Jamesopedia.

365
00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:28.880
So per the script, here are some details.

366
00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:34.600
Stanley, in the script it says, is wearing a creature from the Black Lagoon rubber mask

367
00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.420
with his regular suit.

368
00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:36.960
Okay.

369
00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:45.600
Creed, per the script, is an amazing Joker from Batman, whereas Kevin is a, quote, lame Joker.

370
00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:49.880
And in the script it says, Dwight is also a Joker.

371
00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.740
Kelly is Carrie Bradshaw from Sex and the City.

372
00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:55.340
Ryan is Gordon Gekko from Wall Street.

373
00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:57.020
Very fitting for Ryan.

374
00:14:57.780 --> 00:14:59.120
Oscar is Uncle Sam.

375
00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:00.500
Meredith, a cheerleader.

376
00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.320
Phyllis is Raggedy Ann.

377
00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:08.200
Andy, per the script, it says, he's dressed as a cat with whiskers on his face.

378
00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.940
Angela has brought back her cat costume.

379
00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:12.140
Always a classic.

380
00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:15.920
And Jim is just wearing a name tag that says, Dave.

381
00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:22.060
And of course, Pam, the solo Halloween costume wearer at corporate is dressed as Charlie Chaplin.

382
00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:22.640
Yes.

383
00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:26.160
I reached out to our wardrobe designer, Alicia Raycraft.

384
00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.060
Oh, great.

385
00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:31.800
So starting this season, Alicia took over for Carrie Bennett.

386
00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:37.460
Alicia was amazing, particularly, I think, at building wardrobe from scratch.

387
00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:47.260
My memories of her when I would visit her in the wardrobe trailer were that she always had, like, one of those fabric mannequins with, like, swatches on it, pinned on it,

388
00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.200
or on her wall.

389
00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:51.240
I am telling you, she was always pinning something to something.

390
00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:51.560
Yes.

391
00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.440
And then standing back and looking at it.

392
00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:53.560
Yes.

393
00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:55.680
And then moving a swatch here, up and down.

394
00:15:55.680 --> 00:16:03.000
She said that with this episode, she had to really ride the line of designing wardrobe,

395
00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:08.020
but also making sure that the costumes looked like things that we could have put together ourselves.

396
00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:08.520
Right.

397
00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:13.200
The idea is that if Kevin is going to dress like the Joker, it'd be Kevin's effort.

398
00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.360
It'd be, like, something Kevin had to put together.

399
00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:15.940
Yes.

400
00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:21.480
Like you said, the script said that Creed's Joker was supposed to be the best version of the Joker.

401
00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.120
Kevin's was supposed to be lame.

402
00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:24.640
And they're the Dark Knight Joker.

403
00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:26.700
Yes, that's what Alicia said.

404
00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:30.600
They were supposed to be based on the Heath Ledger Joker.

405
00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:36.240
And so she had a picture, and she made a shopping list, and she still had her shopping liSt.

406
00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:36.960
Stop it.

407
00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.100
I love her.

408
00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:39.400
This is what it said.

409
00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:43.980
They had to go shop for a vest with a high neck center front.

410
00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:46.660
Green for Creed, not for Kevin.

411
00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:49.640
Because Creed got it right, and Kevin didn't.

412
00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:50.140
Correct.

413
00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:54.380
They needed a gray or dark lilac patterned shirt.

414
00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:18.380
She said the overall direction in shopping for Kevin was that all of the clothes they purchased should look like they came from his closet,

415
00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:23.960
and the direction for Creed was that Creed went out and picked it out specifically for Halloween.

416
00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:24.540
Yeah.

417
00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:30.420
But for Dwight, she said they went with a nod to the Jack Nicholson version of the Joker.

418
00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:37.080
I thought something was different when I rewatched it, because the way they drew the smile did not look like the Heath Ledger Joker.

419
00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:42.660
That's how they were like, how do we do three Jokers, but it's not all the same costume or the same look.

420
00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:51.300
But she also shared with me that she brought in a rack of clothes and that Rain really put together his costume from everything she had bought,

421
00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:53.940
which tracks with when we talked to Carrie.

422
00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:58.480
And Carrie Bennett said that Rain was always really invested in what his character wore.

423
00:17:58.700 --> 00:17:59.540
That's awesome.

424
00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:01.160
So let's see, what's next?

425
00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:04.500
We got a lot of questions about Andy's kitten costume.

426
00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.100
Mm-hmm.

