00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.320
He was not just going to draw whiskers on his face, guys.

435
00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:53.200
Alicia said she showed Greg a bunch of photos from the Broadway musical of Cats and Greg picked his favorites, but she did not base this cat on any one character.

436
00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:54.200
It was a meld.

437
00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:54.740
Mm-hmm.

438
00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:56.900
She built that whole costume from scratch.

439
00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:59.900
She bought a unitard and hand-painted it.

440
00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:01.980
She used to do textile painting.

441
00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:02.380
Wow.

442
00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:03.760
I mean, that's amazing.

443
00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.400
And then she found another email that she shared with me.

444
00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:15.800
It was an email to her crew detailing how to build the little, like, fur diaper thing that he's wearing.

445
00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:17.280
What is it, right?

446
00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:18.440
Yeah, I don't know.

447
00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.360
It looks like fur underwear.

448
00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:20.680
Yes.

449
00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.860
And then there's also, like, a rope belt and a tail and, oh, my goodness.

450
00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:24.460
Yes.

451
00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:34.900
She said, please make a loincloth using a thong or small brief underwear as a base and then swatch Phelps, wool crepe, and heavy knits on top.

452
00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.300
And please get faux fur for some gloves.

453
00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:41.080
So amazing.

454
00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:46.520
So that is how she put together all of those costumes, which were really amazing.

455
00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:47.900
And I remember my costume.

456
00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:52.200
We did, like, Pam went to a store and rented a tux, basically.

457
00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:54.320
Well, I took a lot of photos this day.

