00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:07.360
I was walking by you guys in my cat costume, and I see Rain as the Joker talking to Jenna as Charlie Chaplin, just casually hanging out.

461
00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.320
And so I took pictures.

462
00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:10.520
They're some of my favorite.

