00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:12.540
Well, I think he put that one in his book.

464
00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:13.640
I gave it to him.

465
00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:13.900
Yeah.

466
00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:14.600
That's from me.

467
00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:24.160
I loved this episode, Angela, because I had been away for a very long time at Pratt, but, you know, the corporate offices were over on the warehouse set.

468
00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.320
We never got to see you.

469
00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:26.840
But you did on this day.

