00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:33.120
And I got to participate in the Halloween, which was always one of my favorite things on our show.

472
00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:38.800
And I would have been really bummed if I didn't get to see everybody in their costumes, but I got to be in hair makeup.

