00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:40.580
And we were in there a long time.

474
00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:43.920
Me, not so long, but, oh, my gosh, Ed had to come in really early.

475
00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:44.360
Yeah.

476
00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:45.780
And so did Phyllis.

477
00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.320
Like, there was a lot of makeup there.

