00:28:52.360 --> 00:28:53.900
It's in a seven-hour drive.

668
00:28:54.220 --> 00:28:55.300
Well, it's not that bad.

669
00:28:55.780 --> 00:28:58.940
But if I'm really jonesing to see you guys, I can always fly.

