00:29:10.360 --> 00:29:12.400
It's another two and a half hour drive to Scranton.

677
00:29:12.600 --> 00:29:13.800
Assuming there's no traffic.

678
00:29:13.980 --> 00:29:15.380
Well, I just wanted to say goodbye.

679
00:29:15.540 --> 00:29:15.780
Okay.

680
00:29:19.300 --> 00:29:20.780
I just wanted to say goodbye.

681
00:29:21.000 --> 00:29:21.620
Right, right.

682
00:29:21.840 --> 00:29:25.280
But like, she's trying to make, like, it's not going to be that bad.

683
00:29:25.360 --> 00:29:26.860
And he's like, well, I don't know about that.

684
00:29:27.440 --> 00:29:31.420
Like, that person, Oscar was so good at being that person.

685
00:29:31.700 --> 00:29:37.440
So it keeps coming up in this episode that it is seven hours from Scranton to Nashua.

686
00:29:37.660 --> 00:29:38.620
Did you Google it?

687
00:29:38.780 --> 00:29:39.660
