00:32:15.710 --> 00:32:18.970
Some tidbits from Dave Rogers.

764
00:32:19.230 --> 00:32:25.390
They filmed this using lipstick cameras in the car and for the most part used a tow car.

765
00:32:25.610 --> 00:32:28.790
So they had a big old truck that pulled the truck.

766
00:32:29.130 --> 00:32:30.790
Craig was not actually driving.

